{"productId": "bb845b41-39af-4763-8263-b4508a2e64e9", "modelName": "PC Carbine", "modelDescription": "The Ruger PC Carbine is a well-balanced, fast-handling weapon that delivers rapid fire with readily available 9x19mm ammunition. The carbine is adaptable, with interchangeable magazine wells, for use with either GLOCK pistol magazines, or Ruger SR9, Security-9, and Ruger American pistol magazines. The receiver is CNC-milled from a 7075-T6 aluminum billet and Type III hard-coat anodized for maximum durability; and, the receiver comes with an integrated Picatinny rail. The durable, glass-filled nylon synthetic stock has a forward mounted accessory rail, proprietary texturing on the grip surfaces, and a rubber buttpad with spacers to adjust length of pull (includes three 1/2\" spacers). The PC Carbine takes down quickly for storage or transport, by pushing a recessed lever and twisting the barreled fore-end from the receiver and pulling them apart.", "manufacturerName": "Ruger", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "2606df53-299e-4c69-b860-c402007962fd", "description": "Ruger, PC Carbine Takedown, Semi Automatic, 9mm, 16.12\" Non Threaded Barrel, Black Finish, Black Synthetic Stock, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/64dd99e7-d791-4ec4-b921-2e3a97002e64", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/2dc28659-f557-4972-ac8b-d2c2744f331a", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/f15fee2e-900f-45f7-b56a-38f41b150392", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/2e3bf910-c9e2-4a0e-91d5-0673a55ca39a"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "19101", "upc": "736676191017", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "1937a917-3f18-422b-bdf3-d388ad679bac", "attributeName": "Muzzle Device", "attributeValueId": "70323049-0894-4df9-94ac-d2c71c1356b1", "valueName": "None"}, {"attributeNameId": "2ec4f4e1-4aed-47a2-bb02-cd7f86849836", "attributeName": "Hand", "attribute